      "writtenOn": "2023-04-24T21:40:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Each connection gives a controller with the specified type.\nThe equivalent to the current setup __ and the default I will put int place __ would be `Controller { tcp_port: 6402, preset: DEFAULT }`.\n\nHaving multiple ports enables testing with heterogeneous configurations. e.g. mixing extended and legacy scanning capabilities, verifying proper validation of remote capabilities, etc.",
      "parentUuid": "01afeb02_3971e3c8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 33,
        "startChar": 17,
        "endLine": 33,
        "endChar": 25
      },
      "revId": "2320be8828f5a34573505c70396c7d2a7446e911",
