      "writtenOn": "2023-04-24T21:43:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s one way to do it.  The reason I asked is because I could also imagine configuring and connecting until you had enough controllers.\n\nOne port:\n- Configure\n- Connect\n- Configure\n- Connect\n...\n\nI\u0027m wondering what the benefit of multiple ports is, compared to that.\n\nI\u0027m thinking about GRPC-based connections as well.",
      "parentUuid": "fe9d8281_de27cdde",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 33,
        "startChar": 17,
        "endLine": 33,
        "endChar": 25
      },
