      "writtenOn": "2023-04-24T21:48:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would like to avoid adding the requirement that a gRPC connection must be established to configure the controller. Netsim is already adding this feature, I think adding it to rootcanal would be redundant.\n\nI thought about adding a vendor command to set the preferred configuration at boot time, but that requires modifying the host.\n\nHaving multiple ports is the same as having multiple devices, and connecting to one.",
